{"title": "Animate Dead", "pageid": 2757, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Animate_Dead", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 3 Spells", "Necromancy spells", "Spells that gain benefits at higher levels", "Spells that can be transcribed", "Actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Animate_Dead.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Animate_Dead.webp/300px-Animate_Dead.webp, /w/images/1/19/Animate_Dead.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Animate_Dead.webp/300px-Animate_Dead.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/19/Animate_Dead.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Animate Dead </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 3 necromancy spell</a>. It allows spellcasters to animate a corpse to create an <a href=\"/wiki/Undead\" title=\"Undead\">undead</a> servant.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Animate a corpse to create an undead servant while not in combat. \n</p>\n<span style=\"color: white;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-prereq\">The target must be a Medium or Small corpse.</span></span><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 3 Spell Slot</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 3 m (10 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 3 m (10 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<ul><li>When the spell is cast at 4th Level, raise up to 3 <a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Skeleton_Squad\" title=\"Animate Dead: Skeleton Squad\">Skeletons</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Zombie_Battalion\" title=\"Animate Dead: Zombie Battalion\">Zombies</a> instead of 1.</li>\n<li>When the spell is cast at 5th Level, raise a <a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Ghoul\" title=\"Animate Dead: Ghoul\">Ghoul</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Flying_Ghoul\" title=\"Animate Dead: Flying Ghoul\">Flying Ghoul</a>.</li>\n<li>When the spell is cast at 6th Level, raise up to 3 <a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Ghoul_Pack\" title=\"Animate Dead: Ghoul Pack\">Ghouls</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Flying_Ghoul_Flock\" title=\"Animate Dead: Flying Ghoul Flock\">Flying Ghouls</a> instead of 1.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_AnimateDead</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_AnimateDead\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_AnimateDead\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsLinkedSpellContainer_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsLinkedSpellContainer (spell flag)\">IsLinkedSpellContainer</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variants\"> Variants </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Skeleton\" title=\"Animate Dead: Skeleton\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Animate_Dead_Skeleton_Icon.webp/40px-Animate_Dead_Skeleton_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Animate_Dead_Skeleton_Icon.webp/60px-Animate_Dead_Skeleton_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Animate_Dead_Skeleton_Icon.webp/80px-Animate_Dead_Skeleton_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Animate Dead: Skeleton\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Animate_Dead_Skeleton_Icon.webp/40px-Animate_Dead_Skeleton_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Animate_Dead_Skeleton_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Skeleton\" title=\"Animate Dead: Skeleton\">Animate Dead: Skeleton</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Zombie\" title=\"Animate Dead: Zombie\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp/40px-Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp/60px-Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp/80px-Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Animate Dead: Zombie\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp/40px-Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Zombie\" title=\"Animate Dead: Zombie\">Animate Dead: Zombie</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Skeleton_Squad\" title=\"Animate Dead: Skeleton Squad\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Animate_Dead_Skeleton_Icon.webp/40px-Animate_Dead_Skeleton_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Animate_Dead_Skeleton_Icon.webp/60px-Animate_Dead_Skeleton_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Animate_Dead_Skeleton_Icon.webp/80px-Animate_Dead_Skeleton_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Animate Dead: Skeleton Squad\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Animate_Dead_Skeleton_Icon.webp/40px-Animate_Dead_Skeleton_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Animate_Dead_Skeleton_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Skeleton_Squad\" title=\"Animate Dead: Skeleton Squad\">Animate Dead: Skeleton Squad</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Zombie_Battalion\" title=\"Animate Dead: Zombie Battalion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp/40px-Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp/60px-Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp/80px-Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Animate Dead: Zombie Battalion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp/40px-Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Zombie_Battalion\" title=\"Animate Dead: Zombie Battalion\">Animate Dead: Zombie Battalion</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Ghoul\" title=\"Animate Dead: Ghoul\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp/40px-Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp/60px-Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp/80px-Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Animate Dead: Ghoul\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp/40px-Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Ghoul\" title=\"Animate Dead: Ghoul\">Animate Dead: Ghoul</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Flying_Ghoul\" title=\"Animate Dead: Flying Ghoul\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp/40px-Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp/60px-Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp/80px-Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Animate Dead: Flying Ghoul\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp/40px-Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Flying_Ghoul\" title=\"Animate Dead: Flying Ghoul\">Animate Dead: Flying Ghoul</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Ghoul_Pack\" title=\"Animate Dead: Ghoul Pack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp/40px-Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp/60px-Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp/80px-Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Animate Dead: Ghoul Pack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp/40px-Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Ghoul_Pack\" title=\"Animate Dead: Ghoul Pack\">Animate Dead: Ghoul Pack</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Flying_Ghoul_Flock\" title=\"Animate Dead: Flying Ghoul Flock\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp/40px-Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp/60px-Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp/80px-Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Animate Dead: Flying Ghoul Flock\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp/40px-Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Animate_Dead_Ghoul_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead:_Flying_Ghoul_Flock\" title=\"Animate Dead: Flying Ghoul Flock\">Animate Dead: Flying Ghoul Flock</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 5: <a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">Cleric</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Circle_of_the_Spores\" title=\"Circle of the Spores\">Circle of the Spores</a> (Circle Spell), <a href=\"/wiki/Warlock\" title=\"Warlock\">Warlock</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Tome\" title=\"Pact of the Tome\">Pact of the Tome</a> once per long rest), and <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Domain\" title=\"Death Domain\">Death Domain</a> (Domain Spell)</li><li> Class level 6: <a href=\"/wiki/College_of_Lore\" title=\"College of Lore\">College of Lore</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Secrets\" title=\"Magical Secrets\">Magical Secrets</a>) and <a href=\"/wiki/Necromancer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Necromancer\">Necromancer</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Necromancy_School\" title=\"Necromancy School\">Necromancy School</a>)</li><li> Class level 9: <a href=\"/wiki/Oathbreaker\" title=\"Oathbreaker\">Oathbreaker</a> (Oath Spell)</li><li> Class level 10: <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Secrets\" title=\"Magical Secrets\">Magical Secrets</a>)</li></ul>\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Circle_of_Bones\" title=\"Circle of Bones\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Circle_of_Bones_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Circle_of_Bones_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Circle_of_Bones_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Circle_of_Bones_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Circle_of_Bones_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Circle_of_Bones_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Circle_of_Bones_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Circle_of_Bones_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Circle_of_Bones_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Circle_of_Bones\" title=\"Circle of Bones\">Circle of Bones</a></span> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizards</a> with <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 3 Spell Slots</a> can <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Animate_Dead\" title=\"Scroll of Animate Dead\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Scroll_of_Animate_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Animate_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Scroll_of_Animate_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Scroll_of_Animate_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Scroll_of_Animate_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Scroll_of_Animate_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Scroll_of_Animate_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Animate_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Scroll_of_Animate_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Animate_Dead\" title=\"Scroll of Animate Dead\">Scroll of Animate Dead</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Each individual caster can only have one active instance of this spell at once, no matter which version is used. Casting it again while an undead summons is already present dismisses the previous one.</li>\n<li>Wizards with the Necromancy School subclass can raise an additional undead for each level and version of the spell.</li>\n<li>None of these summoned undead have melee weapons, so they are not affected by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Hate\" title=\"Aura of Hate\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Aura_of_Hate_Icon.webp/20px-Aura_of_Hate_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Aura_of_Hate_Icon.webp/30px-Aura_of_Hate_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Aura_of_Hate_Icon.webp/40px-Aura_of_Hate_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aura of Hate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Aura_of_Hate_Icon.webp/20px-Aura_of_Hate_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a5/Aura_of_Hate_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Hate\" title=\"Aura of Hate\">Aura of Hate</a> from Oathbreaker Paladin.</li>\n<li>A Sorcerer may apply <a href=\"/wiki/Metamagic:_Twinned_Spell\" title=\"Metamagic: Twinned Spell\">Twinned Spell</a> on a casting of Animate Dead from a Scroll, but only one creature is raised; the other is immediately destroyed as if the caster had cast two instances, wasting <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcery_Point\" title=\"Sorcery Point\">Sorcery Points</a> in the process.</li>\n<li>If the caster unprepares this spell, the summoned undead will remain.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Visuals\"> Visuals </span></h2>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><div class=\"embedvideo-wrapper embedvideo--local-embed-style\" style=\"position: relative;\"><div class=\"embedvideo-localEmbedStyle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"embedvideo-overlay\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__fakeButton\">Play Video</div><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__footer\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__service\">Local File</div></div></div></div></div><video src=\"https://bg3.wiki/w/images/3/37/Animate_Dead_Visuals.mp4\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 640px; height: auto;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Animate_Dead_Visuals.mp4\">https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Animate_Dead_Visuals.mp4</a></video></div></span> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a 